# How big is Jupiter?
subtitle: "The planets drawn at their true sizes: how many Earths fit inside Jupiter, and why it weighs far less than its size suggests."

## How big is Jupiter?
use: solar_system
with: {"view":"row","scale":"sizes","date":"2026-09-06"}

